    "In Intervals.icu open Settings, scroll to Developer Settings and copy the API key. The key gives full access to your account; it never leaves this phone except to call intervals.icu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En Intervals.icu abre Ajustes, baja hasta Developer Settings y copia la clave API. La clave da acceso total a tu cuenta; nunca sale de este teléfono salvo para llamar a intervals.icu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Intervals.icu Settings, connect Garmin and enable Upload planned workouts. Then sync your Edge with Garmin Connect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En los ajustes de Intervals.icu, conecta Garmin y activa Upload planned workouts. Luego sincroniza tu Edge con Garmin Connect."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In OnelapFit, open your bike computer settings → Workouts → New Training. Recreate the blocks below, save, and sync to your C6xx or C7xx. Confirm the workout runs in outdoor mode with GPS on your firmware." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En OnelapFit, abre los ajustes del ciclocomputador → Workouts → New Training. Crea los bloques de abajo, guarda y sincroniza con tu C6xx o C7xx. Confirma que el entrenamiento funcione en modo exterior con GPS en tu versión de firmware."
          }
        }
      }
    },
